        }
      ],
      "updated": 1788092594903,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.Dectet the vehicle - 🚗\n(identyfy the vehicle model size etc.)\n\n2. dectet the number_plate - 🚘 \n(then extract the number link - WB23AB54)\n\n3. check the databce - yes\n\n4. mark the timestamp \n\n5.mark the cordinetes and camera !",
      "fontSize": 46.08068987763001,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.Dectet the vehicle - 🚗\n(identyfy the vehicle model size etc.)\n\n2. dectet the number_plate - 🚘 \n(then extract the number link - WB23AB54)\n\n3. check the databce - yes\n\n4. mark the timestamp \n\n5.mark the cordinetes and camera !",
