    {
      "id": "ZCjbOQfWznyhFW_rOlE8i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -9245.942353317743,
      "y": -1914.2531387536296,
      "width": 3366.975169835101,
      "height": 4975,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 834036142,
      "version": 474,
      "versionNonce": 582903726,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788155653065,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Repo 1 — ai-service\n\nResponsibility: Camera + OpenCV + YOLO + Tracking + ANPR/OCR + Re-ID\n\nAPIs\n\nPOST /api/v1/events/detection\nPOST /api/v1/events/batch\nGET  /api/v1/cameras/{camera_id}/status  - \nPOST /api/v1/cameras/{camera_id}/heartbeat - \n\nWork:\n\nCapture/process camera feed\n\nDetect vehicles- yolo\n\nTrack vehicles- yolo\n\nDetect/read  number plates -ANPR/OCR\n\nGenerate vehicle embeddings- [23432 4235234 23523543]\n\nCreate detection events       \n{\ncamera_id\ntimestamp\nlocal_track_id\nvehicle_type\nplate_number\nplate_confidence \nvehicle_embedding\nvehicle_confidence\nbounding_box\n}\n\n\nSend events to Backend\n\nReport camera/AI service status\n\nAI → Backend: Detection/Event data\n\n\n---\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRepo 2 — backend\n\nResponsibility: Database + Vehicle Identity + Trajectory + Analytics + Authentication\n\n\nAPIs for AI\n\nPOST /api/v1/events/detection\nPOST /api/v1/events/batch\n\nAPIs for Frontend\n\nGET  /api/v1/vehicles/{vehicle_id}\nGET  /api/v1/vehicles/{vehicle_id}/trajectory\nGET  /api/v1/vehicles/{vehicle_id}/events\nGET  /api/v1/vehicles/search\n\nGET  /api/v1/cameras\nGET  /api/v1/cameras/{camera_id}\n\nGET  /api/v1/traffic\nGET  /api/v1/traffic/{camera_id}\nGET  /api/v1/traffic/route/{route_id}\n\nGET  /api/v1/analytics/overview\nGET  /api/v1/analytics/cameras/{camera_id}\n\nPOST /api/v1/auth/login\nPOST /api/v1/auth/refresh\nGET  /api/v1/auth/me\n\nReal-time\n\nWS /api/v1/ws/traffic\nWS /api/v1/ws/vehicle/{vehicle_id}\n\nWork:\n\nReceive AI events\n\nStore events in PostgreSQL(victor databace)/PostGIS\n\nGenerate/maintain global vehicle ID\n\nCross-camera matching\n\nBuild trajectories - HMM - Hidden Markov Model, Vitervi algo\n\nCamera/location/deraction management- \n\nTraffic analytics\n\nAuthentication/authorization\n\nProvide APIs to Frontend\n\nPush real-time updates\n\n\n\n---\n\nRepo 3 — frontend\n\nResponsibility: UI + Map + Visualization\n\nFrontend does NOT create backend APIs.\n\nIt consumes Backend APIs:\n\nGET /vehicles/{vehicle_id}\nGET /vehicles/{vehicle_id}/trajectory\nGET /vehicles/search\n\nGET /cameras\nGET /cameras/{camera_id}\n\nGET /traffic\nGET /traffic/{camera_id}\nGET /traffic/route/{route_id}\n\nGET /analytics/overview\n\nPOST /auth/login\nGET /auth/me\n\nWS /ws/traffic\nWS /ws/vehicle/{vehicle_id}\n\nWork:\n\nLogin\n\nPublic traffic dashboard\n\nAuthorized dashboard\n\nVehicle search\n\nVehicle details\n\nTrajectory on MapLibre\n\nCamera visualization\n\nTraffic heatmap\n\nCongestion indicators\n\nCharts/analytics\n\nReal-time updates\n\n\n\n---\n\nSimple Dependency\n\nAI SERVICE\n    │\n    │ Detection Events\n    ↓\nBACKEND\n    │\n    ├── PostgreSQL/PostGIS\n    ├── Vehicle Matching\n    ├── Trajectory Engine\n    └── Traffic Analytics\n    │\n    │ REST + WebSocket\n    ↓\nFRONTEND\n\nMost important rule\n\nAI owns AI APIs.\nBackend owns business/data APIs.\nFrontend owns UI only.\n\nSo your team can work independently without constantly modifying each other's repositories.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Repo 1 — ai-service\n\nResponsibility: Camera + OpenCV + YOLO + Tracking + ANPR/OCR + Re-ID\n\nAPIs\n\nPOST /api/v1/events/detection\nPOST /api/v1/events/batch\nGET  /api/v1/cameras/{camera_id}/status  - \nPOST /api/v1/cameras/{camera_id}/heartbeat - \n\nWork:\n\nCapture/process camera feed\n\nDetect vehicles- yolo\n\nTrack vehicles- yolo\n\nDetect/read  number plates -ANPR/OCR\n\nGenerate vehicle embeddings- [23432 4235234 23523543]\n\nCreate detection events       \n{\ncamera_id\ntimestamp\nlocal_track_id\nvehicle_type\nplate_number\nplate_confidence \nvehicle_embedding\nvehicle_confidence\nbounding_box\n}\n\n\nSend events to Backend\n\nReport camera/AI service status\n\nAI → Backend: Detection/Event data\n\n\n---\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRepo 2 — backend\n\nResponsibility: Database + Vehicle Identity + Trajectory + Analytics + Authentication\n\n\nAPIs for AI\n\nPOST /api/v1/events/detection\nPOST /api/v1/events/batch\n\nAPIs for Frontend\n\nGET  /api/v1/vehicles/{vehicle_id}\nGET  /api/v1/vehicles/{vehicle_id}/trajectory\nGET  /api/v1/vehicles/{vehicle_id}/events\nGET  /api/v1/vehicles/search\n\nGET  /api/v1/cameras\nGET  /api/v1/cameras/{camera_id}\n\nGET  /api/v1/traffic\nGET  /api/v1/traffic/{camera_id}\nGET  /api/v1/traffic/route/{route_id}\n\nGET  /api/v1/analytics/overview\nGET  /api/v1/analytics/cameras/{camera_id}\n\nPOST /api/v1/auth/login\nPOST /api/v1/auth/refresh\nGET  /api/v1/auth/me\n\nReal-time\n\nWS /api/v1/ws/traffic\nWS /api/v1/ws/vehicle/{vehicle_id}\n\nWork:\n\nReceive AI events\n\nStore events in PostgreSQL(victor databace)/PostGIS\n\nGenerate/maintain global vehicle ID\n\nCross-camera matching\n\nBuild trajectories - HMM - Hidden Markov Model, Vitervi algo\n\nCamera/location/deraction management- \n\nTraffic analytics\n\nAuthentication/authorization\n\nProvide APIs to Frontend\n\nPush real-time updates\n\n\n\n---\n\nRepo 3 — frontend\n\nResponsibility: UI + Map + Visualization\n\nFrontend does NOT create backend APIs.\n\nIt consumes Backend APIs:\n\nGET /vehicles/{vehicle_id}\nGET /vehicles/{vehicle_id}/trajectory\nGET /vehicles/search\n\nGET /cameras\nGET /cameras/{camera_id}\n\nGET /traffic\nGET /traffic/{camera_id}\nGET /traffic/route/{route_id}\n\nGET /analytics/overview\n\nPOST /auth/login\nGET /auth/me\n\nWS /ws/traffic\nWS /ws/vehicle/{vehicle_id}\n\nWork:\n\nLogin\n\nPublic traffic dashboard\n\nAuthorized dashboard\n\nVehicle search\n\nVehicle details\n\nTrajectory on MapLibre\n\nCamera visualization\n\nTraffic heatmap\n\nCongestion indicators\n\nCharts/analytics\n\nReal-time updates\n\n\n\n---\n\nSimple Dependency\n\nAI SERVICE\n    │\n    │ Detection Events\n    ↓\nBACKEND\n    │\n    ├── PostgreSQL/PostGIS\n    ├── Vehicle Matching\n    ├── Trajectory Engine\n    └── Traffic Analytics\n    │\n    │ REST + WebSocket\n    ↓\nFRONTEND\n\nMost important rule\n\nAI owns AI APIs.\nBackend owns business/data APIs.\nFrontend owns UI only.\n\nSo your team can work independently without constantly modifying each other's repositories.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
